Package: rcamelspe
Title: Catchment Attributes and Meteorology for Peru (CAMELS-PE)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    c(person(given = "Paul E.",
                 family = "Santos Andrade",
                 role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
                 email = "paulefrens@gmail.com",
                 comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6635-0375"))) 
Description: Download, load, manage, and filter the Catchment Attributes and
    Meteorology for Large-Sample Studies - Peru (CAMELS-PE) dataset for
    hydroclimatic and hydrological analysis. Offers high-performance reading
    and manipulation of large datasets using the 'arrow' and 'collapse'
    packages. Provides tools to extract catchment-scale meteorological time
    series, physical attributes, and spatial boundaries.
